    "body": "In Chrome, our current implementation has not shown benefits in early experimentation, and unfortunately there are no immediate plans for going back to the drawing board and re-experimenting. Since nothing in this issue is actionable, and we're probably blocked on Chrome trying to show a benefit for this feature, I'll close this, and re-open if/when necessary.",
